---
id: whey-protein-shake
title: Whey Protein Shake
category: snacks

yield:
  servings: 1
  cooked_g: 266

storage:
  fridge_days: 1
  freezer_friendly: false

---

Add 1 cup (250 ml) of cold water to a shaker bottle, then 1 level scoop of @whey-protein-isolate{1%scoop}. Seal and shake hard for 15 to 20 seconds until no lumps remain, and drink right away.
